        "accession_number": "0001576280-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In September 2014, we entered into a supply agreement with Illumina, Inc., or Illumina, for Illumina to provide products and services that can be used for certain research and clinical activities, including certain sequencers, reagents, and other consumables for use with the Illumina sequencers, as well as service contracts for the maintenance and repair of the sequencers.",
        "start_character": 43055,
        "end_character": 43430
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001576280-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001576280-26-000013-02f0510539a00f72",
        "accession_number": "0001576280-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Therefore, we believe that there is a critical need to develop products to expand precision oncology to earlier stage cancer settings.",
        "start_character": 12601,
        "end_character": 12735
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001576280-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001576280-26-000013-02f0510539a00f72",
        "accession_number": "0001576280-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have provided testing services to patients covered by commercial payers with many cancer types and indications, some of the time as a non-participating provider.",
        "start_character": 29273,
        "end_character": 29437
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001576280-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001576280-26-000013-02f0510539a00f72",
        "accession_number": "0001576280-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As we continue to grow our sales organization, we are also expanding our reach to include large community practices, community oncology networks, integrated delivery payer-owned systems and government medical facilities that are looking for a reliable partner for comprehensive molecular information testing.",
        "start_character": 23319,
        "end_character": 23627
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001576280-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001576280-26-000013-02f0510539a00f72",
        "accession_number": "0001576280-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Because we manufacture our own LDTs solely for use by or within our own laboratory, we believe that we are currently exempt from these reporting requirements.",
        "start_character": 106507,
        "end_character": 106665
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001576280-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001576280-26-000013-02f0510539a00f72",
        "accession_number": "0001576280-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we are aware that certain of our customers are also developing their own tests and may decide to enter our market or otherwise stop using our tests.",
        "start_character": 45655,
        "end_character": 45816
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001576280-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001576280-26-000013-02f0510539a00f72",
        "accession_number": "0001576280-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we file for patent protection in connection with our on-going research and development activities, particularly those related to early-stage cancer detection.",
        "start_character": 48479,
        "end_character": 48650
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001576280-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001576280-26-000013-02f0510539a00f72",
        "accession_number": "0001576280-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In order to ensure that we are meeting our human capital objectives, we regularly utilize employee engagement surveys to understand the effectiveness of our employee development and compensation programs and where we can improve across the company.",
        "start_character": 114660,
        "end_character": 114908
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001576280-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001576280-26-000013-02f0510539a00f72",
        "accession_number": "0001576280-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Similar to our data development effort for our Guardant360 tests, we are investing heavily in establishing clinical validity and utility for the use of Guardant Reveal in adjuvant treatment and surveillance settings.",
        "start_character": 11629,
        "end_character": 11845
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001576280-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001576280-26-000013-02f0510539a00f72",
        "accession_number": "0001576280-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Similarly, as we have experienced with our existing contracted payers, we cannot assure that the addition of new contracted payers will increase our average selling price or revenue.",
        "start_character": 31532,
        "end_character": 31714
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001576280-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001576280-26-000013-02f0510539a00f72",
        "accession_number": "0001576280-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "To that end, we offer a comprehensive total rewards package that includes market-competitive fixed and/or variable pay, broad-based equity grants and bonuses, access to medical, dental, vision and life insurance benefits, disability coverage, fertility subsidies, retirement savings plans, paid time off and family leave, caregiving support, fitness, cellphone and internet reimbursements, and mental health and other wellness benefits.",
        "start_character": 115421,
        "end_character": 115857
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001576280-26-000013",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001576280-26-000013-02f0510539a00f72",
        "accession_number": "0001576280-26-000013",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Using data collected from our tests and through AI-enabled analytical tools, we have also developed our GuardantINFORM platform to help biopharmaceutical companies accelerate precision oncology drug development through the use of this in-silico research platform to unlock further insights into tumor evolution and treatment resistance across various biomarker-driven cancers.",
        "start_character": 1982,
        "end_character": 2358
      }
    ]
